OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny isolated showers in the
OL,6,Fmorning will fade away rather quickly,
OL,7,Fas cloud lifts and breaks into the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Becoming dry, with sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Feeling pleasantly warm for
OL,10,Fall in a light westerly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear and dry for much of the
OL,13,Fnight with some patch cloud across the
OL,14,Fnorth. Feeling fresh and rather cool
OL,15,Ffor all.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FCloud will linger in the
OL,18,Fnorth and high ground first thing but
OL,19,Fwill lift quickly. Bright and sunny
OL,20,Finto the afternoon, feeling pleasantly
OL,21,Fwarm in the sun.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
